{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7YubiKit5CTAP2O9ExtensionO10HmacSecretV","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","extendedModule":"YubiKit","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HmacSecret","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/GetAssertionOperations","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/MakeCredentialOperations","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/Secrets"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/init()","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/init(session:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/getAssertion","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/makeCredential"]},{"anchor":"Type-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret\/isSupported(by:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HmacSecret"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This extension allows a relying party to derive symmetric keys from a credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using HMAC-SHA-256 with user-provided salts. The derived keys can be used for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encryption or other cryptographic operations."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"MakeCredential-Usage","text":"MakeCredential Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request hmac-secret support when creating a credential:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let hmacSecret = CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret()","let ext = hmacSecret.makeCredential.input()","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ hmac-secret is enabled","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Or derive secrets at registration time (CTAP 2.2 hmac-secret-mc):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.input(salt1: salt, salt2: salt2)","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    switch result {","    case .enabled:","        \/\/ hmac-secret-mc not supported, but hmac-secret is enabled","    case .secrets(let secrets):","        \/\/ Use derived keys (secrets.first, secrets.second)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"GetAssertion-Usage","text":"GetAssertion Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Derive keys during authentication:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extensio